      "id": "worker_erlang_c_structural_source",
      "domain": "call_center_staffing",
      "title": "call center staffing method",
      "summary": "A call center modeled Poisson arrivals, exponential handling, c parallel agents, and one FIFO queue as M/M/c. It used Erlang C: a=lambda/mu, rho=a/c; P(wait)=[a^c/(c!*(1-rho))]/[sum(k=0 to c-1) a^k/k! + a^c/(c!*(1-rho))]; mean queue wait Wq=P(wait)/(c*mu-lambda). It evaluated adjacent stable integers and chose the smallest whose Wq met the wait SLO.",
      "signature": {
        "goal": [
          "solve analogous estimation or decision"
        ],
        "constraints": [
          "use observed quantities"
